+ * the same SDK, with the QP taken from the V4L2 controls
+ * V4L2_CID_MPEG_VIDEO_H264_I_FRAME_QP and V4L2_CID_MPEG_VIDEO_H264_P_FRAME_QP
+ * (p->i_qp, p->p_qp; both default to 30). Userspace can change them while
